# 8. Patient Record / Episode

A patient can have one or more records or episodes under the same patient number.

A record or episode represents a prosthetic or orthotic service case.

Each record should include:

* Patient number
* Patient
* Location
* Assessment type
* Record status
* Date of assessment
* Prescription details
* Fitting records
* Delivery records
* Follow-up records
* Uploaded files

Recommended record status options:

* Active
* Completed
* Cancelled

Open date and closed date are not required for now.

