# 9. Assessment Creation

## 9.1 Assessment Type

The user must select:

* Prosthetic
* Orthotic

When Prosthetic is selected, show prosthetic assessment workflow.

When Orthotic is selected, show orthotic assessment workflow.

## 9.2 Common Assessment Fields

All assessments should include:

* Patient number
* Patient
* Location
* Date of Assessment
* Assessment Type
* Main Problem Type
* Side
* Cause / Reason / Pathology Type
* Additional Assessment Information
* Prescription Type

## 9.3 Side Selection

The handwritten notes show the values under Main Problem / Side section.

Side options:

* Left
* Right
* Bilateral

If Bilateral is selected:

* Show Prescription for Left
* Show Prescription for Right
* Each prescription should be selected from dropdown
* Left and right prescriptions can be different

## 9.4 Main Problem Type

Main Problem Type should be a dropdown field.

The exact list should be confirmed from the client if there are more values.

From the handwritten pattern, the side values are:

* Left
* Right
* Bilateral

These belong to Side, not Main Problem Type.

## 9.5 Cause / Reason / Pathology Type

Cause / Reason / Pathology Type should be a dropdown field.

The exact list must be confirmed if the client has standard values.

Suggested values for first version:

* Congenital
* Trauma
* Disease
* Amputation
* Stroke
* Diabetes-related
* Other

If Other is selected, show text box.

