# 12. Fitting Details

## 12.1 Unlimited Fitting Dates

The system must allow unlimited fitting dates.

The handwritten notes mention 2nd, 3rd, and 4th fitting dates, but the confirmed requirement is unlimited fitting entries.

Each fitting entry must include:

* Fitting date
* Notes
* Created by
* Created date
* Updated by
* Updated date

## 12.2 Fitting Notes

Each fitting date must have its own note.

Example:

* 1st fitting date and note
* 2nd fitting date and note
* 3rd fitting date and note
* Additional fitting dates and notes

## 12.3 Add / Change Fitting Date

Fitting date add/change option should be available from the main record screen or first screen.

Users should not need to go deep into the record to update fitting dates.

---

# 13. Delivery Details

## 13.1 Delivery in Appointment Creation

Delivery must be available in the appointment creation screen.

## 13.2 Delivery Record

Delivery must also be stored as a delivery record under the patient number and record/episode.

Delivery fields:

* Date of Delivery
* Notes / Remarks
* Delivery confirmation attachment, if uploaded
* Created by
* Created date
* Updated by
* Updated date

## 13.3 Delivery Not Pending

Delivery must not be shown as a pending appointment.

Delivery should appear in:

* Delivery records
* Delivery reports
* Patient folder
* Printable delivery note

## 13.4 Change Delivery Date

Delivery date must be editable for now.

---

