# 25. Final Remaining Confirmations

Only these items still need confirmation:

1. Exact patient number format.
2. Exact Colombo flag/code in the patient number.
3. Exact yearly reset rule and starting number.
4. Final Main Problem Type dropdown values, if they are not only free text.
5. Final Cause / Reason / Pathology dropdown values.
6. Final Spinal Orthosis prescription dropdown values.
7. Whether duplicate ID should block registration completely or only warn admin.
8. Final design/layout of printable forms.


My recommendation for the dashboard is: use Active Records as the main card, meaning active treatment episodes. Add Active Patients only if they want a separate unique patient count. This avoids confusion when one patient has more than one active prosthetic or orthotic case.